Board support for the VeloCloud Edge 520/540 (Intel Atom C2000 with an
I354 quad-port and two Marvell 88E6176 switches).

Loads the if_vcigb driver for the running OPNsense kernel early at boot,
so the eight LAN ports (two unmanaged 4-port switches, vcigb0/vcigb1) and
GE1/GE2 (vcigb2/vcigb3) are available.  The SFP cages stay on igb.

Adds Interfaces: VeloCloud Edge with per-jack link status, a driver/kernel
match check and boot settings, plus a dashboard widget.  The package
carries one driver module per OPNsense kernel and installs its own package
repository, so new modules arrive with System: Firmware updates.
